4. **`considered_alternatives`** lists any other player you weighed (empty if none).
5. **`rationale_text`** — ONE sentence: state your vote and its single strongest reason. Do not deliberate or hedge.
6. **Honesty about your role is a game rule.** If you are an impostor, vote in character.

